      "style": "normal",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Markdown is a way to style text on the web. You control the display of the document; formatting words as bold or italic, adding images, and creating lists are just a few of the things we can do with Markdown. Mostly, Markdown is just regular text with a few non-alphabetic characters thrown in, like ",
          "_key": "xfg5x2"
        },
